<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3881/86  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7285/95  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9438/48  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4400/10  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.66/67   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.8328/48  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1690.3/0.8 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     114.49/54  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.7287/37  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.2559/09  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.5835/55  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.6535/40</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$337.80/30</p>
</text>
